# Fikr page chrome (unified)

Apply this on every `school-management-unified` **list/settings** page and its dialogs. Reference: `GradeLevelsView.vue` + `GradeModal.vue`, `UserManagementView.vue` + `UserModal.vue`.

**Exception:** none for student register/edit — `/students/register` and `/students/:id/edit` use the same `fk-card` chrome as other admin editors (see `student-register-form.mdc`). Print views, login, and chat remain exceptions.

## Hero

- `FikrPageHeader` gets **title + subtitle only**. Never pass `:eyebrow`.
- Do not put filter / view-toggle / add in the hero `#actions` slot.

## List card header

Title stays at the start. Search, Filter, `ListViewModeToggle`, and + add align to the **end** (`justify-between`) on every administration list page:

```
<header class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-fikr-hairline px-5 py-4 sm:px-6">
  <div class="min-w-0">
    <h2 class="fk-card__title truncate">…</h2>
    <p class="fk-card__meta">…count…</p>
  </div>
  <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center justify-end gap-2">
    <!-- FikrToolbarSearch (when the list has search), FikrFilterButton, ListViewModeToggle, + add -->
  </div>
</header>
```

Search = `FikrToolbarSearch` (ListFilter icon + clear). Filter = icon-only `FikrFilterButton` (gray outline, no fill; `aria-label` only). Add = `fk-iconbtn fk-iconbtn--primary` with `IconPlus` and `aria-label` only. Export = `IconDownload` on `fk-iconbtn`.

## Loading

- Use `FikrLoader` (`@/components/FikrLoader.vue`) for list/page/panel loading — animated FIKR logo, not a circular CSS/SVG ring.
- Default page blocks: `<FikrLoader />` (`md`). Inline/button: `size="xs"` or `size="sm"`.
- Keep sibling loading text if it already exists. Do not replace refresh-icon `:class="{ 'animate-spin': loading }"`.

## List pagination

- Use shared `FikrPagination` (`@/components/FikrPagination.vue`) — sliding teal thumb, ellipsis window (`paginate()`), prev/next chevrons. Primitive: `src/components/ui/pagination.vue` (Vue port; not React/`motion`).
- Place it **below** the list/table inside the list card (`mt-5` + top border), matching `/students/payments` (`StudentChargesView`).
- Client lists: `useClientPagination(filteredItemsRef)` (default page size 20); bind `v-for` to `paginatedItems` and pass `:page`, `:pages`, `@update:page="goToPage"`.
- Server lists: keep the existing page API; swap only the footer chrome to `FikrPagination`.
- Do not use the old “Per page / Previous / Page X of Y / Next” chrome on new or touched lists.

## Row actions (3-dot)

- Use `RowActionsMenu`. The trigger must stay a visible borderless `fk-iconbtn fk-iconbtn--ghost` with three **filled** dots (not a faint stroke-only path).
- Do not put `overflow-hidden` (or a clipping `overflow-x-auto` wrapper) on the card/table that contains the menu. Use `overflow-visible` on `fk-table-wrap`.
- Default menu placement is **up**. Keep Edit / Delete / Archive inside the menu — never as standalone text links.

## Dialogs and filter drawers

- No `:eyebrow` on `FikrDialog` (do not repeat the page title).
- Always `plain-footer`.
- Footer buttons: `fk-btn fk-btn--pearl` (cancel/clear) and `fk-btn fk-btn--primary` (save/create/close).
- Filter drawers: title only (no extra “Filter” eyebrow); same pearl/primary footer, no `fk-actionbar`.
- Field/label look is `/students/register` (`fk-field` / `fk-flabel`) only — see `fikr-form-fields.mdc`. Do not restyle dialog chrome to match the register wizard.

## Do not

- Do not use `fk-actionbar`, `fk-actionbar__ghost`, or `fk-actionbar__primary`.
- Do not add `canvas="ice"` unless this page already uses it (settings only).
- Do not change business logic or `RowActionsMenu` item behavior.
